Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,The envelope was sealed.\NI told myself that meant it wasn't my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:10.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Marlow's first job: carry it through the flood tunnels.\NOne crank. Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:16.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nib came anyway. Said the tunnels take a toll.\NI told him I don't pay tolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:22.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,The envelope was an eviction notice. For a family of mice.\NI was the bad guy's courier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:30.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,The mother thanked me. Said at least the mayor sent someone kind.\NI earned my first crank tonight. It felt like stealing.
